[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11281.67, "timestamp": "03:08:01", "text": "所以，嗯，呃，我刚才说到哪儿了？我当时是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11289.469, "timestamp": "03:08:09", "text": "呃，建造一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11292.269, "timestamp": "03:08:12", "text": "塔。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11299.23, "timestamp": "03:08:19", "text": "嗯，是啊。我不说了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11303.469, "timestamp": "03:08:23", "text": "呃，好的。所以，我的想法是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11307.99, "timestamp": "03:08:27", "text": "从外面看，它像一堵火焰墙。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11311.03, "timestamp": "03:08:31", "text": "连同房子。我的天哪。所以，我想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11315.469, "timestamp": "03:08:35", "text": "比如往里面添加更多东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11320.469, "timestamp": "03:08:40", "text": "就好像我不知道一样。我输了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11325.91, "timestamp": "03:08:45", "text": "希望。我到底想做什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11328.59, "timestamp": "03:08:48", "text": "呃，如何建造一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11332.469, "timestamp": "03:08:52", "text": "塔。塔长什么样？塔"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11333.71, "timestamp": "03:08:53", "text": "的"}]